### **Q2: LICENSE** (2/2)
Make sure your LICENSE file is EXACTLY the Apache 2.0 license. The simplest fix is to:
1. Go to your repository on GitHub
2. Click "Add file" → "Create new file"
3. Name it `LICENSE`
4. GitHub will suggest a license template - choose "Apache License 2.0"
5. Commit the file

Or use the official text from: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt

---

